            "description_html": "<b>Brass Accents A07-K5210, Solid Brass 8\" High Traditional Doctors Door Knocker</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe 8\" Doctor's Door Knocker is fashioned after the symbol used in England to denote the residency of a doctor. Today, this elegant piece adds a sense of tradition to any front door it graces. At 8\" tall, it is perfect for larger doors. It comes packaged with all the necessary mounting hardware.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nBrass Accents provides distinctive craftsmanship with old-world tradition for a lifetime of elegance. Their products are hand finished in the USA. They are one of the world's leading crafters of cast-brass and hot-forged decorative brass hardware.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<!-- <p>\r\nClick here for a smaller version  <a href=\"/products/solid-brass-traditional-doctors-door-knocker-brass-accents-a07-k5200\">6 1/2 Inch High Doctors Door Knocker</a>\r\n</p> -->\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the 8\" Doctors Front Door Knocker:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Height: 8\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Centers: 5-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Max Projection: 3-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"font-size:  14px;\">**This item is DISCONTINUED, None Available</p>",
